+Results: 740 Python tests PASS (36.076 seconds); actual dashboard JavaScript smoke PASS. The complete suite was rerun after durable checkpoint retention, consumer reconnect, awareness coalescing, health and foreground-lifecycle repairs. Actual HTTP/worker subprocess integration with a simulated recipient passed, including SIGTERM cleanup, saved-thread resume and no duplicate task delivery. Syntax, integrity and clean ZIP extraction are checked before publication. Regression tests cover current-event priority, exact original notification context, self-notification suppression, callback/task separation, fallback settlement preserving invoked/uncertain work, authentic receipts, ownership and lease guards, version handshake, HTTP readiness and migration retaining current journal/private routes. No live GitHub/provider calls are made by these tests.
 
-Final suite: 594 Python tests PASS; actual dashboard smoke PASS; Python/Bash syntax and package integrity PASS. Existing delivery, outbox, uncertainty, ownership and startup regressions remain required. No installed-Mac wake proof is claimed: acceptance still needs real version/API readiness, recipient event/ACK/result and PM continuation. No LaunchAgent or login task is installed.
+Installed Mac acceptance remains OPEN: actual installed API/build, existing authenticated recipient route, fresh CI/review event, real receipt/result, PM continuation, and restart retention without copy-paste. Python tests cannot prove that an unsupported ChatGPT browser session wakes. No guarantee of 100% agent coordination is claimed.
